---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About Us" description="ABSL - Global travel, secure logistics, and premium construction services.">
  <div class="container" style="padding: 60px 24px; max-width: 800px;">
    <h1 style="font-family: var(--display); font-size: 2.4rem; margin-bottom: 16px; color: var(--ink);">About ABSL</h1>
    <p style="font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 0.08em; color: var(--cyan); margin-bottom: 40px;">GLOBAL TRAVEL . LOGISTICS . CONSTRUCTION</p>

    <div style="color: var(--ink-muted); line-height: 1.9; font-size: 1rem;">
      <p style="font-size: 1.15rem; color: var(--ink);">Allstates Business Solutions and Logistics Ltd (ABSL) is a Nigerian company delivering excellence in corporate travel management, secure freight forwarding, and premium construction. From boardroom travel bookings to cross-border logistics and residential builds, we serve businesses and executives worldwide.</p>

      <h2 style="font-family: var(--display); color: var(--ink); font-size: 1.3rem; margin-top: 40px;">Our Mission</h2>
      <p>To deliver world-class corporate travel management, secure freight forwarding, and premium construction to businesses and executives worldwide.</p>

      <h2 style="font-family: var(--display); color: var(--ink); font-size: 1.3rem; margin-top: 40px;">What We Offer</h2>
      <ul style="line-height: 2;">
        <li><strong>Corporate Travel:</strong> Ticketing, luxury hospitality, visa procurement, and protocol services.</li>
        <li><strong>Safe Bookings:</strong> All bookings are managed through the ABSL Client Portal with 24/7 traveler support.</li>
        <li><strong>Global Freight:</strong> End-to-end forwarding, customs clearance, and real-time shipment tracking.</li>
        <li><strong>Premium Builds:</strong> Residential and commercial construction with 10-year structural backing.</li>
        <li><strong>Worldwide Coverage:</strong> 170+ destinations and cross-border operations.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 style="font-family: var(--display); color: var(--ink); font-size: 1.3rem; margin-top: 40px;">Why Clients Trust Us</h2>
      <p>We vet our operators, maintain strict compliance with global travel and freight standards, and enforce protocol on every shipment. Every booking inquiry goes through our team, ensuring that both clients and carriers are protected throughout the transaction.</p>

      <h2 style="font-family: var(--display); color: var(--ink); font-size: 1.3rem; margin-top: 40px;">For Businesses</h2>
      <p>ABSL provides businesses with a single partner for corporate travel, freight, and construction. Manage bookings from your client dashboard, track shipments in real-time, and request project estimates.</p>

      <h2 style="font-family: var(--display); color: var(--ink); font-size: 1.3rem; margin-top: 40px;">Get in Touch</h2>
      <p>
        <strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:info@absl.com.ng" style="color: var(--cyan);">info@absl.com.ng</a><br>
        <strong>WhatsApp:</strong> <a href="https://wa.me/2348033355060" style="color: var(--cyan);" target="_blank" rel="noopener">+234 803 335 5060</a><br>
        <strong>Contact Page:</strong> <a href="/contact" style="color: var(--cyan);">Visit our contact page</a>
      </p>

      <div style="margin-top: 48px; padding: 28px; background: var(--cyan-soft); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: var(--r-lg); text-align: center;">
        <h3 style="font-family: var(--display); color: var(--ink); margin: 0 0 8px 0;">Ready to get started?</h3>
        <p style="margin: 0 0 20px 0; font-size: 0.95rem;">Book a service or speak to an expert today.</p>
        <div style="display: flex; gap: 12px; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap;">
          <a href="/travel" class="btn btn-primary" style="padding: 12px 24px;">Browse Services</a>
          <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-ghost" style="padding: 12px 24px;">Contact Us</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>